{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/pulls/447","id":5088574708,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVFVR088AAAABL0189A","html_url":"https://github.com/linhongcun/video-studio/pull/447","diff_url":"https://github.com/linhongcun/video-studio/pull/447.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/linhongcun/video-studio/pull/447.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/447","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/pulls/447/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/pulls/447/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/447/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/statuses/518668ed8585ab66d9e0a6ba23250aa706b769c7","number":447,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"新增 MQ05–MQ07：消费幂等、消息保序与消息积压（v0.97.0）","user":{"login":"linhongcun","id":230383104,"node_id":"U_kgDODbteAA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/230383104?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun","html_url":"https://github.com/linhongcun","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"新增三期可独立观看的 Kafka 视频与配套图文，沿同一事件解释实现过程：\n\n- MQ05 / EP45：数据库积分已提交、Kafka 进度尚未提交时发生重读；展示唯一约束如何仲裁并发、RETURNING 如何控制增量，以及登记与业务共同提交/回滚。\n- MQ06 / EP46：相同 Key 进入同一分区且按序交付，应用内部异步完成仍可能把已退款覆盖为已支付；对照按订单串行完成。\n- MQ07 / EP47：两分区的组扩到十二成员后仍只有两份非空归属；继续追踪 Fetch、poll 与受限通知步骤，按分区推导积压及排空。速率明确为教学假设。\n\n三片分别 5647/5116/6208 帧，均含实际原题/机构资料片尾；共80句、12幅正式成片配图，固定 Kafka 4.4.0，幂等另核 PostgreSQL 18.0。121项真实运行断言与教学模型分别留证。660项新冻结声明、9051份旧冻结实际输入及1348份既有发布文件保护核验通过。\n\n已完成来源/独立确切旁白审稿、声音信号、独立动态、实际成片与JPEG审图；本地原生Chromium226项动作/66严格PTS及实际图审通过，正式构建55份媒体附录、54篇文章与日期/RSS检查通过。首发时间只在实际发布工作流开始写入，预览媒体/文章字节保持。提交前按未改动的canonical密钥规则扫描，5处精确SHA绑定的公开源码标识符逐项核验，无未解决匹配。\n\n保留受控加载时原生海报加载弧、暂停控件遮暗底部字幕和默认颜色转换轻微舍入的真实观察；没有隐藏控件、TLS绕过或HTTP回填。未作逐字ASR、全片人工语义听辨、物理手机或学习效果实验。仅GitHub与本站，合并后发布Release并重新部署，再核验线上完整文件与原生交互后关闭制作issue。冻结的制作README保留当时身份，当前进度以本批归档为准。\n\nRefs #313, #314, #315.","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-30T17:39:27Z","updated_at":"2026-10-30T17:40:00Z","closed_at":"2026-10-30T17:39:59Z","merged_at":"2026-10-30T17:39:59Z","merge_commit_sha":"dcaafde2e30c7fde688e0744d45f2e4e1131c46e","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"linhongcun:codex/mq05-07-implementation-20261030","ref":"codex/mq05-07-implementation-20261030","repo":{"id":1414877651,"node_id":"R_kgDOVFVR0w","name":"video-studio","full_name":"linhongcun/video-studio","owner":{"login":"linhongcun","id":230383104,"node_id":"U_kgDODbteAA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/230383104?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun","html_url":"https://github.com/linhongcun","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.gi